'bourgeois-chateau-du-taillan|2025':{press:{'Falstaff':'91'},src:'chateau-du-taillan-2025-technical-sheet.pdf',taste:'The seventh vintage classified as Cru Bourgeois Exceptionnel, Château du Taillan 2025 stands out with a profile that is both classic and contemporary. It is notable for its aromatic intensity and freshness, placing it firmly in line with modern tastes. At the same time, it retains a more traditional dimension, supported by full ripeness, silky tannins, and a fine length. A round, deep, and powerful wine offering a broad aromatic palette. 2025 in a few points A dry and mild winter and spring ensured excellent vine health, followed by a hot, dry summer with occasional rainy episodes, and finally ideal conditions for the harvest.'},
