'pomerol-chateau-vray-croix-de-gay|2017':{blend:{ME:76,CF:18,MA:6},yld:5.3,months:'8',src:'FT_Plaisir_2017_EN.pdf',taste:'Expressive and complex on the nose revealing fresh fruit aromas, smoky and mineral notes with a hint of blackcurrant buds. Light on the palate with a juicy freshness. Well-balanced. The Vineyard TERROIR : gravel, deep clays, sandy clays SURFACE AREA : 46,18 ha VITICULTURE BY PLOT : 40 plots, in conversion to organic viticulture and using biodynamic cultivation techniques.'},
